      "longBusinessSummary": "Embassy Bancorp, Inc. operates as the bank holding company for the Embassy Bank for the Lehigh Valley that provides various banking and related financial products and services to individual, business, and government customers in Pennsylvania. The company offers time, savings, money market, and demand deposits; checking, individual retirement, and NOW accounts; and certificates of deposit. It also provides loans, such as secured fixed and variable rate loans; commercial lending; consumer lending, including mortgage loans, first time home buyer mortgages, secured home equity loans, lines of credit, auto loans, and unsecured personal loans; residential mortgage loans; and commercial mortgage/construction loans. In addition, the company offers various other services, such as ACH origination, bank by mail, cash management, credit/debit card merchant processing, escrow management, fraud detection, night depository, person to person payment, personal financial management, positive pay, remote deposit capture, saving bond redemption, wire transfer, and direct deposit/ACH services. Further, it provides automated teller machines; treasurer and certified checks; ATM and debit cards; safe deposit boxes; commercial and consumer credit cards; and gift cards, as well as mobile and online banking, and bill pay services. The company was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Bethlehem, Pennsylvania.",
